def test_plan(model, ctx, retries): ...
```

How many test items does pytest collect for `test_plan`?

```python
@pytest.fixture(scope="module")
def cache():
    return {}

def test_a(cache):
    cache["k"] = 1
    assert cache == {"k": 1}

def test_b(cache):
    assert cache == {}
```

What is the outcome?
